Design a pipeline register that captures and holds the outputs of an execute stage within a processing pipeline. It inputs signals such as `ewreg`, `em2reg`, `ewmem`, the computed ALU result `ealu`, and the second operand `eb`, as well as the register number `ern`, while synchronizing with a clock signal and an active-low reset. Upon a clock edge, it transfers these inputs to its corresponding outputs (`mwreg`, `mm2reg`, `mwmem`, `malu`, `mb`, `mrn`), thereby facilitating data flow between pipeline stages during sequential processing.
module top_module( ewreg,em2reg,ewmem,ealu,eb,ern,clock,resetn,
                mwreg,mm2reg,mwmem,malu,mb,mrn);

