Design a 9-bit counter that increments on each positive clock edge, resetting to zero when it reaches a count of 511 or when the active-low reset (rst_n) signal is asserted. The module outputs the current count value through the data_out signal, which is also reset to zero under the same conditions. This structure allows for synchronous counting while ensuring that the output reflects the state of the counter accurately, with specific behavior on reset or reaching the maximum count limit.
