description:
Design a sequence detector circuit that identifies the specific input pattern "1011" from a serial input stream. The module uses a 4-bit shift register to capture the incoming bits and a finite state machine (FSM) with four states (S0 to S3) to track progress through the detection sequence. Upon detecting the complete sequence, the output is set high for one clock cycle, indicating the presence of the pattern, while a reset input allows for reinitialization of the state and output.
