description:
Implement a Verilog module for a 4-bit Johnson counter with synchronous reset. When reset is high, the counter should reset to 4'b0000. Otherwise, it should shift its bits to the left and invert the leftmost bit.
module johnson_counter (
    input clk,
    input reset,
    output reg [3:0] count
);

code:
module johnson_counter (
    input clk,
    input reset,
    output reg [3:0] count
);always @(posedge clk) begin
        if (reset)
            count <= 4'b0000;
        else
            count <= {~count[3], count[3:1]};
    end

endmodule

